{"id":"d83d7732ede02eef","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md","title":"ZFC Rudimentary Function","display":"df-zfc-rudimentary-function — ZFC Rudimentary Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function"],"display":"df-zfc-rudimentary-function — ZFC Rudimentary Function","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rudimentary-function — ZFC Rudimentary Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,n,k,m,b,\\vec c,\\vec x,x,y,z\\in V\">\\(c,n,k,m,b,\\vec c,\\vec x,x,y,z\\in V\\)</span>；自然数是 von Neumann 自然数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^n\">\\(V^n\\)</span> 表示域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的有限集合函数的元语言类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle=\\{\\{x\\},\\{x,y\\}\\}\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle=\\{\\{x\\},\\{x,y\\}\\}\\)</span>；本文件的三元关系坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y,z\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}=\\langle x,\\langle y,z\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y,z\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}=\\langle x,\\langle y,z\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>。代码中的其他有限元组均为有穷函数图。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(r)=\\{x:\\exists y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in r)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(r)=\\{x:\\exists y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in r)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r[\\{x\\}]=\\{y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in r\\}\">\\(r[\\{x\\}]=\\{y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in r\\}\\)</span>，并不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 是函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0,\\ldots,R_8\">\\(R_0,\\ldots,R_8\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompCode}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n\">\\(\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EvalRud}\">\\(\\operatorname{EvalRud}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EvalRud}\">\\(\\operatorname{EvalRud}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle c,\\vec x\\rangle:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)\\land\\vec x\\in V^n)\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle c,\\vec x\\rangle:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)\\land\\vec x\\in V^n)\\}\\)</span>；这是类函数模式，不是全宇宙上的集合函数图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbf b:=\\langle2,2,1,1,2,1,1,1,2\\rangle,\\\\\nR_0(x,y):=\\{x,y\\},\\qquad R_1(x,y):=x\\setminus y,\\qquad\nR_2(x):=\\bigcup x,\\qquad R_3(x):=\\operatorname{dom}(x),\\\\\nR_4(x,y):=x\\times y,\\qquad\nR_5(x):=\\{z\\in x:\\exists a,b\\;(z=\\langle a,b\\rangle\\land a\\in b)\\},\\\\\nR_6(x):=\\{\\langle b,a,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}:\\langle a,b,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}\\in x\\},\\qquad\nR_7(x):=\\{\\langle b,c,a\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}:\\langle a,b,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}\\in x\\},\\\\\nR_8(x,y):=\\{x[\\{a\\}]:a\\in y\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbf b:=\\langle2,2,1,1,2,1,1,1,2\\rangle,\\\\\nR_0(x,y):=\\{x,y\\},\\qquad R_1(x,y):=x\\setminus y,\\qquad\nR_2(x):=\\bigcup x,\\qquad R_3(x):=\\operatorname{dom}(x),\\\\\nR_4(x,y):=x\\times y,\\qquad\nR_5(x):=\\{z\\in x:\\exists a,b\\;(z=\\langle a,b\\rangle\\land a\\in b)\\},\\\\\nR_6(x):=\\{\\langle b,a,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}:\\langle a,b,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}\\in x\\},\\qquad\nR_7(x):=\\{\\langle b,c,a\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}:\\langle a,b,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}\\in x\\},\\\\\nR_8(x,y):=\\{x[\\{a\\}]:a\\in y\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i)&amp;:=\\langle0,n,i\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i)&amp;:=\\langle1,i\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1})&amp;:=\\langle2,b,\\langle c_i:i\\in m\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i):i\\in n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i):i\\in9\\land\\mathbf b(i)=n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i)&amp;:=\\langle0,n,i\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i)&amp;:=\\langle1,i\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1})&amp;:=\\langle2,b,\\langle c_i:i\\in m\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i):i\\in n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i):i\\in9\\land\\mathbf b(i)=n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,0}&amp;:=\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k+1}&amp;:=\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1}):\nm\\in\\omega,\\ b\\in\\mathsf{Rud}_{m,k},\\ \\vec c\\in(\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k})^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land c\\in\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,0}&amp;:=\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k+1}&amp;:=\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1}):\nm\\in\\omega,\\ b\\in\\mathsf{Rud}_{m,k},\\ \\vec c\\in(\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k})^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land c\\in\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec x\\in V^n\\land i\\in n\\quad&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i),\\vec x):=\\vec x(i),\\\\\ni\\in9\\land\\vec x\\in V^{\\mathbf b(i)}\\quad&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i),\\vec x):=\nR_i(\\vec x(0),\\ldots,\\vec x(\\mathbf b(i)-1)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(b,m)\\land\n\\bigl[\\forall i\\in m\\;\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c_i,n)\\bigr]\n\\land\\vec x\\in V^n\\quad&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1}),\\vec x)\n&amp;:=\\operatorname{EvalRud}\\bigl(b,\\langle\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c_i,\\vec x):i\\in m\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec x\\in V^n\\land i\\in n\\quad&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i),\\vec x):=\\vec x(i),\\\\\ni\\in9\\land\\vec x\\in V^{\\mathbf b(i)}\\quad&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i),\\vec x):=\nR_i(\\vec x(0),\\ldots,\\vec x(\\mathbf b(i)-1)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(b,m)\\land\n\\bigl[\\forall i\\in m\\;\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c_i,n)\\bigr]\n\\land\\vec x\\in V^n\\quad&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1}),\\vec x)\n&amp;:=\\operatorname{EvalRud}\\bigl(b,\\langle\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c_i,\\vec x):i\\in m\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>各构造子由首标签与元组长度区分；求值递归作用于严格较小的代码子树。求值只在声明的域上使用。</li>\n<li>保留“有限基元加复合”的原语法，不把任意集合递归或传递闭包误加为 rudimentary 基元。这里没有零元基元，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rud}_{0,k}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{Rud}_{0,k}=\\varnothing\\)</span>；原闭包谓词并未额外要求载体非空。</li>\n<li>九个基元按本书的有序对及关系像方向书写；不把一个既定的函数族替换为任意外加函数表。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<p>A. R. D. Mathias and N. J. Bowler, <em>Rudimentary recursion and provident sets</em>, Hamburg preprint 613, §2, pp. 13–15. 本文使用其有限生成构造，关系图方向与本书一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c,n,k,m,b,\\vec c,\\vec x,x,y,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"V^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle=\\{\\{x\\},\\{x,y\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y,z\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}=\\langle x,\\langle y,z\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(r)=\\{x:\\exists y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in r)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r[\\{x\\}]=\\{y:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"R_0,\\ldots,R_8","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EvalRud}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EvalRud}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle c,\\vec x\\rangle:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)\\land\\vec x\\in V^n)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbf b:=\\langle2,2,1,1,2,1,1,1,2\\rangle,\\\\\nR_0(x,y):=\\{x,y\\},\\qquad R_1(x,y):=x\\setminus y,\\qquad\nR_2(x):=\\bigcup x,\\qquad R_3(x):=\\operatorname{dom}(x),\\\\\nR_4(x,y):=x\\times y,\\qquad\nR_5(x):=\\{z\\in x:\\exists a,b\\;(z=\\langle a,b\\rangle\\land a\\in b)\\},\\\\\nR_6(x):=\\{\\langle b,a,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}:\\langle a,b,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}\\in x\\},\\qquad\nR_7(x):=\\{\\langle b,c,a\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}:\\langle a,b,c\\rangle_{\\mathrm r}\\in x\\},\\\\\nR_8(x,y):=\\{x[\\{a\\}]:a\\in y\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i)&:=\\langle0,n,i\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i)&:=\\langle1,i\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1})&:=\\langle2,b,\\langle c_i:i\\in m\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n&:=\\{\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i):i\\in n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i):i\\in9\\land\\mathbf b(i)=n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function\\text{-}zero}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,0}&:=\\mathsf{RudBasic}_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k+1}&:=\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1}):\nm\\in\\omega,\\ b\\in\\mathsf{Rud}_{m,k},\\ \\vec c\\in(\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k})^m\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rudimentary\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c,n)&\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land c\\in\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathsf{Rud}_{n,k}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec x\\in V^n\\land i\\in n\\quad&\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}(n,i),\\vec x):=\\vec x(i),\\\\\ni\\in9\\land\\vec x\\in V^{\\mathbf b(i)}\\quad&\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}(i),\\vec x):=\nR_i(\\vec x(0),\\ldots,\\vec x(\\mathbf b(i)-1)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(b,m)\\land\n\\bigl[\\forall i\\in m\\;\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S(c_i,n)\\bigr]\n\\land\\vec x\\in V^n\\quad&\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n\\operatorname{EvalRud}(\\operatorname{CompCode}(b,c_0,\\ldots,c_{m-1}),\\vec x)\n&:=\\operatorname{EvalRud}\\bigl(b,\\langle\\operatorname{EvalRud}(c_i,\\vec x):i\\in m\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rud}_{0,k}=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":4211,"backlinks":[{"id":"a6633b5006df9be9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf b$、$\\operatorname{ProjCode}_{58}$、$\\operatorname{BasicCode}_{58}$、$\\operatorname{CompCode}$、$\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S$、$R_i$ 与 $\\operatorname{EvalRud}$ 使用 [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md]]。"},{"id":"cbf54d50c77440e3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudimentaryFunctionCode}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (带元数的 rudimentary-function 代码谓词, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3333","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function.md|58-df-zfc-rudimentary-function]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5045d216c83e75cb"]}